  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given that,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ba</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pH</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>pOH</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pOH</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>pH</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pOH</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>OH</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><mi>Ba</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mo>&#8652;</mo><munder><msup><mi>Ba</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></munder></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Ba</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p>Therefore, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>.</p>"
